Total history text uses the valuation commodity's declared precision.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight total-history --accounts Assets:Cash

========== FILE ==========

commodity EUR
  default
  format 1,000.000 EUR
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1234.5678 EUR
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01  1,234.568 EUR

========== WARNINGS ==========
